      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this code works when our 32-bit us timer is approaching overflow. For example, if our timer currently stands at 1 second until overflow (0xffffffff - 1 second) and I set a deadline at 1 second past overflow (0x0 + 1 second \u003d 2 seconds from now), we\u0027ll ignore future calls which actually set a sooner deadline, eg. a deadline at .5 seconds until overflow (1000000 \u003c )0xffffffff - 500000)).",
