      "side": 1,
      "message": "Considering the situation you mentioned: If deadline is cross overflow value (0xFFFFFFFF), the evt_expired_us will be zero.\n\nPlease see the line 73 in timer.c (https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/common/timer.c#73). If deadline\u0027s high 32 bits are not equal to now\u0027s high 32 bits, it will call __hw_clock_event_clear() and that\u0027s why I put this line here. Rearrange events after ITIM32 overflow interrupt is issued.",
